+ * @value: PCS register value
+ * @bits:	PCS register bits
+ *		@pwr_lim_2:	Bits [16:0] - Power Limit 2
+ *		@pwr_lim_2_en:	Bits [17:17] - Power Limit 2 Enable
+ *		@pwr_clmp_lim_2:Bits [18:18] - Critical Power Clamp 2
