+
 config SENSORS_ACBEL_FSG032
 	tristate "ACBEL FSG032 Power Supply"
 	help
@@ -447,6 +458,15 @@ config SENSORS_Q54SJ108A2
 	  This driver can also be built as a module. If so, the module will
